 "summary": "The new material has no upstream replacement: Mathlib has no `covarianceMatrix` for a family and no real-valued `variance_eq_zero_iff`, TauCeti's `covMatrix` is the matrix of a measure on `EuclideanSpace` (bridged here in both directions), and its `dotProduct_extend_zero` covers only the right factor. The PR reuses `Matrix.toBilin'`/`toQuadraticForm'`, `polar_toQuadraticMap`, `covariance_fun_sum_fun_sum`, `PosSemidef.dotProduct_mulVec_zero_iff` and `isClosed_setOfPred_posSemidef` instead of reproving them.",
